260/extras/9fea11917b84656b6b2172e72524214f.poster.avif?t=1739296843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/9fea11917b84656b6b2172e72524214f.webm?t=1739296843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/9fea11917b84656b6b2172e72524214f.mp4?t=1739296843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>By the end, you will know but 4 words:</i><br><br><strong>ACTION, EXPLORATION, STEALTH, AND BLOOD.</strong><br><br>Inspired by classic, innovative games like Castlevania and Hollow Knight. Nourished by the fury of Dead Cells and the gloom of Bloodborne. Lose yourself in a labyrinthine city, full of secrets and madness.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/b4a88bc21aa1af9a471265f7df4d3368.poster.avif?t=1739296843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/b4a88bc21aa1af9a471265f7df4d3368.webm?t=1739296843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/b4a88bc21aa1af9a471265f7df4d3368.mp4?t=1739296843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/b93091c57c26e0adfeb57a0c027a7db9.avif?t=1739296843\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Novel stealth-lite gameplay mixed with platforming and brutal action<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305260/extras/9d7061b2200424d6c1c430ced7241bda.poster.avif?t=1739296843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13